{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Version Available!</strong><br>Experience the opening three episodes of the epic story in <i>Fantasy Maiden Wars - Dream of the Stray Dreamer -</i> and get a taste of the gameplay to come. Just like in the full release, you can choose your protagonist\u2014either Reimu, the shrine maiden, or Marisa, the magician.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 Don\u2019t miss the rest of the adventure\u2014play the full game to continue the journey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972200/extras/e22f127054524d3d3fadd6e478e7a78f.avif?t=1758770332\" data-has-big width=1560 height=285 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fantasy Maiden Wars</strong> is a classic tactical RPG where you command a diverse cast of characters and battle your way through stage-based missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in <i>Gensokyo</i>, a world where humans, youkai, and gods coexist, you'll team up with  unique allies to confront a series of supernatural incidents shaking the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972200/extras/1228abf604b823aaf3ed2733c64ea83b.avif?t=1758770332\" data-has-big width=1560 height=79 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your units across grid-based maps, take down enemies with strategic positioning and turn-based tactics, and clear stages to progress the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels and a full-featured tutorial system make this a perfect entry point for players new to the genre\u2014while offering plenty of depth for veterans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972200/extras/9bc40c2597f3dc4f2ee17b5b041d5e37.avif?t=1758770332\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972200/extras/fe25ec95e6830e2c2cedd1ae76a38511.avif?t=1758770332\" data-has-big width=1560 height=79 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in beautifully animated battles whenever characters clash. From sword slashes and gunfire to devastating Spell Card finishers, every attack is brought to life with flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your favorite characters unleash flashy moves in the rich, vibrant world of Gensokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972200/extras/bf955bfe6f2e7913ca0e913c524f5b5e.avif?t=1758770332\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972200?t=1758770332","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3972200?t=1758770332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972200/0054f5dca7e38be89372ab0a40cd9d1198febc30/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758770332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3972200/0054f5dca7e38be89372ab0a40cd9d1198febc30/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758770332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Version Available!</strong><br>Experience the opening three episodes of the epic story in <i>Fantasy Maiden Wars - Dream of the Stray Dreamer -</i> and get a taste of the g